ges/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></span><br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> the potion.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Aoe Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>Creates area: Potion of Supreme Healing</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing\"> Area: Potion of Supreme Healing </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_(cloud)\" title=\"Potion of Supreme Healing (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/45px-Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Supreme Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_(cloud)\" title=\"Potion of Supreme Healing (cloud)\">Potion of Supreme Healing</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Recover <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10d4+20</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a> and stop <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl> </span>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Obtainable from various merchants (usually not until characters have progressed to level 10+)\n<ul><li>Examples of merchants typically offering this item include:</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/25px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/38px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/50px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A'jak'nir Jeera\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/25px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\">A'jak'nir Jeera</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Crèche Y'llek</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Draughts\" title=\"Crimson Draughts\">Crimson Draughts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/25px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/38px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/50px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helsik\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/25px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\">Helsik</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oliver_Tefoco\" title=\"Oliver Tefoco\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/38px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/50px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oliver Tefoco\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver_Tefoco\" title=\"Oliver Tefoco\">Oliver Tefoco</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Beehive_General_Goods\" title=\"Beehive General Goods\">Beehive General Goods</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair\" title=\"Sublimate of Ki-Rin Hair\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair\" title=\"Sublimate of Ki-Rin Hair\">Sublimate of Ki-Rin Hair</a> (procured from<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ki-Rin_Hair\" title=\"Ki-Rin Hair\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/20px-Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/30px-Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/40px-Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/20px-Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki-Rin_Hair\" title=\"Ki-Rin Hair\">Ki-Rin Hair</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Ashes</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Crafting this item can be more expensive than buying it from traders, especially without <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Experime